Task: Use Cached Project Names Map in StackitResourceService
- Updated searchResources(), getBillingSummary(), and getAccessIssues() to use projectDiscoveryService.getProjectNamesMap()
- Avoids triggering redundant remote organization/project discovery scans on every search query, billing summary, or access issue query
- Added unit tests in StackitResourceServiceTest verifying getProjectNamesMap() usage and that discoverProjects() is never called
- Created/Modified files: StackitProjectDiscoveryService.java, StackitResourceService.java, StackitResourceServiceTest.java
- Why: Replaces expensive remote discovery calls with fast O(1) in-memory cache lookup
